{"src":"en","tgt":"hi","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"hi","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7957.979482,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8808.550658,"text":"हालाँकि, इस मामले में शेन्ज़ेन ज़ोन कुछ हद तक एक देश की तरह काम करता है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":8918.315431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8922.971771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8928.075874,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":8933.474322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8935.616895000001,"samples":25528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":15117.689817,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15967.469846000002,"text":"मक्का के उत्तर में स्थित पहाड़ों में से एक की चोटी पर स्थित, यह गुफा काफी करीब से"},{"kind":"audio","t":16081.920334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":16087.163626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16092.431697000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":16097.842166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16102.276091000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":16102.700934000002,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17741.113564,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18194.412583999998,"text":"दुनिया के बाकी हिस्सों से अलग-थलग है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":18295.821502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18300.978655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18304.056933,"samples":30464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":26273.664357999998,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27121.649597,"text":"अब लोग कंप्यूटर स्क्रीन पर संदेश लिखते हैं और उन्हें कभी शार्पनर के पास आने की ज़रूरत नहीं पड़ती।"},{"kind":"audio","t":27229.617285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27231.887716999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27233.076707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27234.64408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27236.136305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27237.420213999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":27237.734387999997,"samples":4992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37523.888139,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":38711.937389000006,"text":"भारी कराधान वाले देशों की यात्रा करने वाले यात्री कभी-कभी काफी पैसा बचा सकते हैं, खासकर शराब और तंबाकू जैसे उत्पादों पर।"},{"kind":"audio","t":38893.334978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38895.002230000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38896.406686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38898.041228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38899.659841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":38901.062477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":38902.506223000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38903.398578,"samples":31024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":45771.353544000005,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46380.945546,"text":"पौधे प्रकाश संश्लेषण द्वारा सूर्य से अपना भोजन बनाते हैं। वे छाया भी प्रदान करते हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":46572.789499000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":540,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46578.273656000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":46583.193003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46588.472004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46593.700826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46595.346408000005,"samples":22760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":58058.896739,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59328.092020000004,"text":"अस्पताल ने संक्रमण नियंत्रण के प्रोटोकॉल का पालन किया है, जिसमें दूसरों को संभावित संक्रमण से बचाने के लिए रोगी को अन्य लोगों से अलग रखना शामिल है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":59451.237632000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59452.667227000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59454.006155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59455.515819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":59457.090953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59458.690506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59459.999524,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59461.721434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59462.548211,"samples":31856,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":68161.88235,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69434.754289,"text":"किया गया कार्य अधिकतर सैद्धांतिक था, लेकिन प्रोग्राम सैजिटेरियस गैलेक्सी के किए गए अवलोकनों का अनुकरण करने के लिए लिखा गया था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":69556.92022700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69562.169669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":69567.19461400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69572.615853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":69577.865594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69582.86955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69588.104001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69589.693204,"samples":29224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":78496.134059,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79642.897446,"text":"बार्सिलोना की आधिकारिक भाषाएं कैटलन और स्पेनिश हैं। लगभग आधे लोग कैटलन बोलना पसंद करते हैं, एक बड़ा बहुमत इसे समझता है, और लगभग हर कोई स्पेनिश जानता है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":79860.983116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79862.597608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79863.94010600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79865.46123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79866.953185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79868.49286900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":79869.989574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79871.65853500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79873.16253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79874.304951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":79874.458308,"samples":1720,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":83794.35714600001,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":84762.732824,"text":"कुछ क्षेत्रों में, पानी को एक मिनट तक उबालना पर्याप्त है और अन्य क्षेत्रों में कई मिनटों की आवश्यकता होती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":84876.020822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":500,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84880.815481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84886.152311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84891.365223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84896.583915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":84901.963244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84902.356507,"samples":14592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":89842.93008,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":90764.539017,"text":"पौधे प्राकृतिक वातावरण में सबसे अच्छे लगते हैं, इसलिए एक तना निकालने के प्रलोभन से भी बचें।"},{"kind":"audio","t":90874.439862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90879.793502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":90885.21728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90891.16614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90896.46424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90901.402377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":90901.68559200001,"samples":8592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97586.749935,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98652.415661,"text":"1920 के दशक के दौरान, अधिकांश नागरिकों और राष्ट्रों का प्रचलित दृष्टिकोण शांतिवाद और अलगाववाद का था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":98769.738251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98775.223658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98780.360272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98785.538304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98790.690617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98795.893539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":98801.472175,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98801.90790800001,"samples":14224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":103527.761364,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104589.24697000001,"text":"मासा सेरिफ अपने समय का सर्वोच्च शिकारी था, इसलिए वह अन्य मोसुल के अलावा किसी बात से नहीं डरता था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":104701.974398,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104707.390167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104712.52685000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":104717.752812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104723.018413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104728.235705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104729.514633,"samples":20592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":113141.074739,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114571.102596,"text":"1537 में असुनसियन की स्थापना के बाद से, पराग्वे अपनी बहुत सी स्वदेशी विशेषताओं और पहचान को बनाए रखने में सफल रहा है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":114744.230484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114749.937748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114754.884565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114760.188635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114765.31963900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114770.497151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":114774.762359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114778.2519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114778.63426400001,"samples":14456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":119856.361592,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120940.821601,"text":"यह बीमारी सूअरों द्वारा फैलाई जाती है, जो फिर मच्छरों के माध्यम से मनुष्यों में फैल जाती है।"},{"kind":"audio","t":121143.952072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":540,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121149.25417300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121154.407016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121159.965502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121165.109566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121166.68436900001,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":129343.14353300001,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130230.36668,"text":"अधिकांश आधुनिक अनुसंधान दूरबीनें अनुकूल वायुमंडलीय स्थितियों वाले दूरदराज के क्षेत्रों में स्थित विशाल सुविधाएं हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":130352.18545399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130357.36503700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":130362.14817600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130367.61310399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130372.828786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130378.079997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":130383.29983900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130383.66601300001,"samples":13024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":135427.37635500001,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136155.90992,"text":"लोग यह अनुमान नहीं लगा सकते कि यात्रियों के लिए धैर्य और समझ भी आवश्यक हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":136345.067138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136348.390772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":136351.647547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":136355.13677800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":136357.583137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":136357.841672,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140542.168647,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141239.991451,"text":"इसलिए यह संभव है कि नोटेशन को केवल एक लेबल के रूप में जोड़ा गया था।"},{"kind":"audio","t":141457.598188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141462.734932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141467.801136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141472.94029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141475.367979,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":147773.60550900002,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148576.300423,"text":"लेकिन पक्षियों के बारे में ऐसी बहुत सी बातें हैं जो अभी भी डायनासोर जैसी लगती हैं।"},{"kind":"audio","t":148691.395621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148696.594893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148701.843884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":148707.113286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148712.300048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":148712.591963,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":154958.518647,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155803.046244,"text":"वे लगभग सभी रेतीले समुद्र तट हैं जहाँ तैरना सुरक्षित है और अधिकांश में छाया उपलब्ध है जो कि"},{"kind":"audio","t":155911.13413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":530,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155913.072687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":155914.246588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155915.766362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155917.383845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":155918.766451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":155919.027867,"samples":8592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":157897.620516,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158176.48963,"text":"पोहिकन पेड़ों द्वारा।"},{"kind":"audio","t":158266.648538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":510,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158269.142876,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":164345.44352200002,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165509.675245,"text":"डुवल, जो विवाहित हैं और जिनके दो वयस्क बच्चे हैं, ने मिलर पर कोई खास प्रभाव नहीं छोड़ा, जिन्हें यह कहानी सुनाई गई थी।"},{"kind":"audio","t":165626.161349,"samples":32768,"rate":